/****** UP-Shared.mcc/UPM_Shared_Fire ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPM_Shared_Fire -- method of UP-Shared.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       Private method the timer node sends to the owner
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPM_Shared_Fire - method id. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Send with DoMethod; see FUNCTION for the return value.
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Shared.mcc
*
******/

/****** UP-Shared.mcc/UPA_Shared_Side ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Shared_Side -- attribute of UP-Shared.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       I/S: preferred side, MUI_AA_TIP_*
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Shared_Side - method id. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Shared.mcc
*
******/

/****** UP-Shared.mcc/UPA_Shared_Origin ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Shared_Origin -- attribute of UP-Shared.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       ---- Constructors: the tag list is the whole interface. Defaults a caller does not give (no frame, cycle chain) are the class's. ----
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Shared_Origin - method id. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Shared.mcc
*
******/
